  triage:title "Watcher/reconcile exclusion proof absent — sprint Required Work 5.1-5.3 test missing" ;
  triage:description "Sprint-S9 Required Work §5 (added by FIX-P1 to resolve PLAN-QA ATM-QA-001) requires a test verifying that ~/.atm/logs/ appends do not trigger reconcile events. Rust-qa confirms the watcher only watches ~/.claude/teams/*/inboxes/ so the behavior is correct by design, but the required verification test is absent. Fix: add a test proving that appending to ~/.atm/logs/atm.log.jsonl produces no reconcile event." ;
